        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86184, Modern Baden Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baden 8 Inch Pull has a modern design that is great for contemporary homes. This rectangular door pull is easy to install and comes with everything you'll need to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. It is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. The Modern Baden Door Handle has an 8 inch center to center length and a 8-5/8 inch overall length.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-8-inch-baden-pull-set-pair-emtek-btb-86184\"><b>Baden Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Baden Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
