                "description": "The Baden 8 Inch Pull has a modern design that is great for contemporary homes. This rectangular door pull is easy to install and comes with everything you'll need to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. It is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. The Modern Baden Door Handle has an 8 inch center to center length and a 8-5/8 inch overall length.\r\n",
